WHY THIS FILE EXISTS AS A POINTER RATHER THAN A FULL COPY. `scitex-app app
validate` requires a LICENSE beside a standalone app's manifest, because an app
submitted to the store travels on its own and must carry its terms with it.
This one does not travel on its own — it ships inside scitex-app — so a
34 KB verbatim copy inside an example directory would add noise without adding
a fact. An app you actually publish should carry the full text.
